// "Join" by traversing a nested association — no join keyword needed.
//
// DHIS2 metadata embeds relationships: a dataElementGroup carries its member
// `dataElements`. So one source + nested navigation gives a group with its items.
// `dataElements.select({...})` projects each member; the field collector requests
// `dataElementGroups?fields=id,name,dataElements[id,name]` for you.
dataElementGroups
  | transform { id: id, name: name, items: dataElements.select({ id: id, name: name }) }
  | limit 10
